488
00:33:12,110 --> 00:33:13,460
I bet that's it.

489
00:33:15,730 --> 00:33:17,210
That's your side job, huh?

490
00:33:17,770 --> 00:33:19,240
You're weird.

491
00:33:26,670 --> 00:33:28,070
What if it's because I wanna make a move?

492
00:33:30,750 --> 00:33:31,720
Make a move?

493
00:33:34,530 --> 00:33:35,630
On me?

494
00:33:36,770 --> 00:33:38,120
I asked for your number

495
00:33:38,890 --> 00:33:40,240
to hit on your brother, I guess.

496
00:33:45,030 --> 00:33:46,030
Smartass.

497
00:33:46,790 --> 00:33:48,020
I won't give it to you, then.

498
00:33:51,720 --> 00:33:53,110
Does "it" mean your number

499
00:33:54,680 --> 00:33:55,800
or permission to hit on you?

500
00:33:57,810 --> 00:33:59,060
Both.

501
00:34:20,389 --> 00:34:22,040
Can I kiss you, Podduang?

502
00:34:52,600 --> 00:34:57,330
♫When we happened to hold hands,
was that when it all started?♫

503
00:34:57,650 --> 00:35:02,360
♫When I somehow memorized your number,
was that when you took my heart?♫

504
00:35:02,740 --> 00:35:07,080
♫Never knew you'd have my heart from the start♫

505
00:35:07,100 --> 00:35:12,430
♫But today, hiding these feelings
suddenly feels so hard♫

506
00:35:13,480 --> 00:35:18,550
♫I'm caught off guard, I don't know what to do,♫

507
00:35:18,570 --> 00:35:23,830
♫So let me just tell you how much I love you♫

508
00:35:23,850 --> 00:35:26,340
♫I fell for you right out of the blue,♫

509
00:35:26,370 --> 00:35:29,200
♫Out of nowhere, I fell for you♫

510
00:35:29,220 --> 00:35:33,920
♫I have no clue when I started feeling this way♫

511
00:35:34,080 --> 00:35:36,890
♫Yet somehow, I fell for you anyway♫

512
00:35:36,920 --> 00:35:40,000
♫All I know is I'm loving you more every day♫

513
00:35:40,020 --> 00:35:44,820
♫Could it be my heart chose you
from the first day?♫

514
00:35:51,610 --> 00:35:52,610
I...

515
00:35:53,770 --> 00:35:54,830
I'd better leave.

516
00:35:55,050 --> 00:35:56,200
♫Is missing you what love feels like?♫

517
00:35:56,220 --> 00:35:57,580
♫You're always on my mind,♫

518
00:35:57,610 --> 00:36:00,080
♫Whatever I do,
I think of you all day and night,♫

519
00:36:00,100 --> 00:36:02,790
♫I guess this is what love feels like♫

520
00:36:04,390 --> 00:36:05,450
Forgot my phone.

521
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:07,580
♫I thought I was just lonely, nothing more,♫

522
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:10,190
♫Then you came so casually,
like you'd done it before,♫

523
00:36:10,220 --> 00:36:12,870
♫You're simply being yourself,
yet somehow I fall,♫

524
00:36:12,890 --> 00:36:15,790
♫So, wanna give it a try and be my all?♫

525
00:36:16,630 --> 00:36:21,690
♫I'm caught off guard, I don't know what to do,♫

526
00:36:21,720 --> 00:36:27,020
♫So let me just tell you how much I love you♫

527
00:36:27,040 --> 00:36:29,540
♫I fell for you right out of the blue,♫

528
00:36:29,560 --> 00:36:32,430
♫Out of nowhere, I fell for you♫

529
00:36:32,460 --> 00:36:37,070
♫I have no clue when I started feeling this way♫

530
00:36:37,090 --> 00:36:39,900
♫Yet somehow, I fell for you anyway♫

531
00:36:40,040 --> 00:36:43,120
♫All I know is I'm loving you more every day♫

532
00:36:43,140 --> 00:36:48,000
♫Could it be my heart chose you
from the first day?♫

533
00:37:11,950 --> 00:37:13,120
Are they really broken?

534
00:37:14,770 --> 00:37:16,020
Dunk, you asshole.

535
00:37:16,630 --> 00:37:18,710
I won't let you borrow my things ever again.

536
00:37:58,350 --> 00:37:59,220
Help me.

537
00:38:00,070 --> 00:38:01,080
Help...

538
00:38:13,480 --> 00:38:14,580
Help me.

539
00:38:34,790 --> 00:38:36,870
Are you sure it wasn't music?

540
00:38:37,150 --> 00:38:37,940
Yeah.

541
00:38:38,710 --> 00:38:39,980
It's just like I told you.

542
00:38:41,250 --> 00:38:42,700
It came from the earbuds.

543
00:39:06,190 --> 00:39:07,050
Help me,

544
00:39:07,070 --> 00:39:07,760
Jin...

545
00:39:08,540 --> 00:39:09,500
Hey, Jin.

546
00:39:11,070 --> 00:39:12,110
Do you believe me?

547
00:39:12,840 --> 00:39:14,140
I'm not crazy.

548
00:39:15,680 --> 00:39:17,300
The sound really came from the earbuds.

549
00:39:17,950 --> 00:39:18,950
It was so clear.

550
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:20,630
It's like...

551
00:39:22,920 --> 00:39:24,670
someone was speaking right in my ear.

552
00:39:27,830 --> 00:39:29,120
Then, would you believe me...

553
00:39:31,510 --> 00:39:32,530
if I told you that...

554
00:39:34,080 --> 00:39:36,380
I've heard those voices
for as long as I can remember?

555
00:39:50,950 --> 00:39:51,990
Jin...

556
00:39:53,680 --> 00:39:54,730
Jin...

557
00:39:57,610 --> 00:39:58,890
Jin...

558
00:40:11,490 --> 00:40:12,600
Your time is up.

559
00:40:16,220 --> 00:40:17,550
Don't cross the road.

560
00:40:48,770 --> 00:40:49,640
Jin...

561
00:40:50,580 --> 00:40:51,450
Jin...

562
00:40:51,900 --> 00:40:52,910
Your time is up.

563
00:40:53,240 --> 00:40:54,140
Jin...

564
00:40:54,770 --> 00:40:55,640
Jin...

565
00:40:56,780 --> 00:40:57,570
Jin...

566
00:40:57,730 --> 00:40:58,420
Help me,

567
00:40:58,440 --> 00:40:59,110
Jin.

568
00:40:59,240 --> 00:40:59,850
Jin.

569
00:40:59,870 --> 00:41:00,780
Your time is up.

570
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:01,550
Jin.

571
00:41:01,660 --> 00:41:02,420
Jin.

572
00:41:02,450 --> 00:41:03,870
Jin, help me.

573
00:41:03,980 --> 00:41:05,810
Those voices won't stop ringing in my head.

574
00:41:06,630 --> 00:41:08,510
There's nothing I can do about them.

575
00:41:10,830 --> 00:41:11,990
That's why I know

576
00:41:12,900 --> 00:41:14,400
that you're not just imagining it...

577
00:41:18,170 --> 00:41:20,090
because I've been hearing those voices, too.

578
00:41:24,070 --> 00:41:25,240
Those voices?

579
00:41:26,880 --> 00:41:28,570
The voice you heard from the earbuds...

580
00:41:30,250 --> 00:41:31,500
is Anda's.

581
00:41:32,710 --> 00:41:36,430
It's the same voice
I've been hearing for a while now.

582
00:41:38,020 --> 00:41:39,270
That's not funny, Jin.

583
00:41:40,750 --> 00:41:42,060
This isn't something to joke about.

584
00:41:42,980 --> 00:41:44,500
Where do you think it came from, then?

585
00:41:48,540 --> 00:41:50,130
I'm not joking, Podduang.

586
00:41:50,510 --> 00:41:51,530
Just believe me.

587
00:41:55,490 --> 00:41:57,610
Anda is still lingering around us.

588
00:42:00,900 --> 00:42:03,280
He really needs our help.

589
00:42:38,880 --> 00:42:39,950
Anda,

590
00:42:40,780 --> 00:42:43,950
if there's anything I can do to help,
let me know.

591
00:42:44,510 --> 00:42:46,230
Who did this to you?

592
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:48,340
Let me help you, Anda.

593
00:42:55,410 --> 00:42:57,100
Your brother just died, Itti.

594
00:42:57,830 --> 00:43:00,020
Won't you even give me time to process this?

595
00:43:00,510 --> 00:43:01,390
Mom,

596
00:43:01,960 --> 00:43:03,130
I understand,

597
00:43:03,570 --> 00:43:05,330
but look at what this is doing to you.

598
00:43:06,290 --> 00:43:08,250
You can't eat or sleep at all.

599
00:43:10,060 --> 00:43:12,640
You're going to keep drowning in grief forever.

600
00:43:14,160 --> 00:43:15,910
I'm worried about you and Dad.

601
00:43:17,050 --> 00:43:18,800
Anda is already gone.

602
00:43:20,030 --> 00:43:21,120
But as for us,

603
00:43:21,750 --> 00:43:23,350
we still have to live on.

604
00:43:26,670 --> 00:43:29,700
Then give me one month

605
00:43:30,830 --> 00:43:32,930
before we cremate him.

606
00:43:34,160 --> 00:43:35,030
Mom,

607
00:43:37,300 --> 00:43:38,520
please let him go.

608
00:43:39,930 --> 00:43:41,030
Itti...

609
00:43:42,280 --> 00:43:44,190
Why won't you listen to me at all?

610
00:43:45,410 --> 00:43:47,440
I asked for three months, and you said no.

611
00:43:48,300 --> 00:43:51,010
Now I'm asking for just one month,
and you still say no.

612
00:43:53,530 --> 00:43:55,190
You're really...

613
00:43:56,700 --> 00:43:58,040
a terrible brother.

614
00:44:02,230 --> 00:44:04,190
You couldn't even protect your brother.

615
00:44:06,930 --> 00:44:10,530
I'm asking for more time with him,
and you won't let me have it.

616
00:44:13,110 --> 00:44:16,830
Fine, then it's up to you.

617
00:44:39,600 --> 00:44:42,240
Hey, want to go to that same place after this?

618
00:44:42,910 --> 00:44:44,510
We need to talk about Anda again.

619
00:44:47,080 --> 00:44:48,110
Hello, Satang?

620
00:44:48,460 --> 00:44:49,530
I'm at the funeral.

621
00:44:49,690 --> 00:44:50,390
Sure.

622
00:44:50,580 --> 00:44:51,420
Say that again.

623
00:44:51,720 --> 00:44:53,330
What happened to the kitchen sink?

624
00:44:53,540 --> 00:44:54,720
The water won't stop running.

625
00:44:54,750 --> 00:44:56,620
I even turned the red valve
like you told me to.

626
00:44:57,190 --> 00:44:57,880
What?

627
00:44:58,590 --> 00:45:00,060
Are you sure you turned it the right way?

628
00:45:00,950 --> 00:45:02,410
How could it still be running?

629
00:45:02,430 --> 00:45:04,200
I turned it the right way!

630
00:45:04,480 --> 00:45:06,090
I turned it so hard it almost broke.

631
00:45:08,660 --> 00:45:09,700
Wait, hold on.

632
00:45:13,570 --> 00:45:14,530
Just a second.

633
00:45:19,940 --> 00:45:20,640
Hey.

634
00:45:21,050 --> 00:45:22,130
Can you hear me?

635
00:45:22,850 --> 00:45:23,810
Hello, Satang?

636
00:45:24,730 --> 00:45:25,570
Can you hear me?

637
00:45:27,200 --> 00:45:27,940
What the hell?

638
00:45:28,460 --> 00:45:29,440
Hello?

639
00:45:30,930 --> 00:45:31,730
Hello?

640
00:45:32,250 --> 00:45:33,250
Hey, hello?

641
00:45:34,290 --> 00:45:35,420
Satang, hello?

642
00:45:37,070 --> 00:45:37,870
Podduang...

643
00:45:41,950 --> 00:45:42,710
Help me.

644
00:45:43,630 --> 00:45:44,700
Help me.

645
00:45:46,670 --> 00:45:47,850
Help me.

646
00:46:05,550 --> 00:46:06,510
Was it you?

647
00:46:06,690 --> 00:46:08,020
You killed him, didn't you?

648
00:46:08,050 --> 00:46:10,480
You planned the whole thing, didn't you?

649
00:46:12,020 --> 00:46:13,300
Say something!

650
00:46:13,640 --> 00:46:14,840
Why aren't you saying anything?

651
00:46:16,260 --> 00:46:17,570
Just answer me!

652
00:46:18,230 --> 00:46:19,400
Don't be a coward!

653
00:46:19,830 --> 00:46:20,720
I didn't do it.

654
00:46:21,100 --> 00:46:22,020
You didn't?

655
00:46:22,230 --> 00:46:24,060
Then what the hell was that chat?

656
00:46:24,410 --> 00:46:25,680
What did you tell the police?

657
00:46:26,090 --> 00:46:26,930
Spit it out!

658
00:46:26,950 --> 00:46:28,090
I told you already.

659
00:46:28,110 --> 00:46:29,270
I've told them everything.

660
00:46:29,730 --> 00:46:30,970
You've told them everything?

661
00:46:31,940 --> 00:46:33,190
- Enough already.
- Enough.

662
00:46:33,210 --> 00:46:33,850
Go.

663
00:46:34,000 --> 00:46:34,710
Shit...

664
00:46:37,630 --> 00:46:39,090
This is my brother's funeral.

665
00:46:40,020 --> 00:46:41,620
If you're going to fight like rabid dogs,

666
00:46:41,710 --> 00:46:42,920
take it outside.

667
00:46:42,950 --> 00:46:44,530
- Aren't you a cop?
- Go.

668
00:46:44,550 --> 00:46:45,950
You should put him in jail!

669
00:46:48,630 --> 00:46:50,170
He's the one who killed Anda.

670
00:46:51,810 --> 00:46:53,150
Just confess already.

671
00:46:53,930 --> 00:46:55,940
- Tell everyone you killed him!
- Stop it.

672
00:46:56,590 --> 00:46:57,420
That's enough.

673
00:46:57,830 --> 00:46:59,040
This is going too far.

674
00:46:59,770 --> 00:47:01,180
My parents are sitting right there.

675
00:47:01,490 --> 00:47:03,570
At the very least, show them some respect.

676
00:47:04,000 --> 00:47:05,280
Do you really think...

677
00:47:05,910 --> 00:47:07,510
that Anda killed himself?

678
00:47:08,630 --> 00:47:10,350
What I think is none of your business.

679
00:47:10,930 --> 00:47:12,300
As for a partner like you,

680
00:47:12,850 --> 00:47:15,530
who only cares about losing your job
because my brother is dead,

681
00:47:16,080 --> 00:47:17,700
go throw your tantrum somewhere else.

682
00:47:17,850 --> 00:47:19,630
Don't do it at my brother's funeral.

683
00:47:25,900 --> 00:47:26,920
Do you get it now?

684
00:47:27,630 --> 00:47:28,920
If you do, please leave.

685
00:47:30,510 --> 00:47:32,810
You ruined my life.

686
00:47:33,020 --> 00:47:33,910
You bastard!

687
00:47:33,940 --> 00:47:34,710
Go.

688
00:47:35,710 --> 00:47:36,420
Leave.

689
00:47:57,050 --> 00:47:57,730
Podduang!

690
00:47:57,760 --> 00:47:59,090
I don't care

691
00:47:59,120 --> 00:48:01,010
whether or not you like Jin.

692
00:48:01,030 --> 00:48:02,390
He doesn't belong to anyone yet,

693
00:48:02,620 --> 00:48:04,490
so let's compete to win him over.

694
00:48:04,510 --> 00:48:05,200
Deal?

695
00:48:05,350 --> 00:48:06,530
Do you want anything?

696
00:48:06,710 --> 00:48:07,610
I'll get it for you.

697
00:48:07,640 --> 00:48:08,750
I can buy it myself.

698
00:48:09,130 --> 00:48:10,690
But I'm sure there's something

699
00:48:10,890 --> 00:48:12,320
that you really want

700
00:48:12,720 --> 00:48:14,360
but money can't buy.

701
00:48:15,100 --> 00:48:16,790
The jacket the vendor is wearing...

702
00:48:17,090 --> 00:48:18,530
I bought it for Anda.

703
00:48:18,740 --> 00:48:20,340
How did my friend's jacket end up with you?

704
00:48:20,360 --> 00:48:21,370
I took it from...

705
00:48:21,570 --> 00:48:23,030
From the dead man's car, right?

706
00:48:50,670 --> 00:48:56,340
♫I used to wonder what we were,♫

707
00:48:57,150 --> 00:49:02,990
♫I thought love needed something clearer,♫

708
00:49:03,830 --> 00:49:09,070
♫Took me time to learn what really matters♫

709
00:49:10,670 --> 00:49:15,750
♫Love has no rules, whatever comes after♫

710
00:49:17,150 --> 00:49:22,550
♫As long as I know what my heart wants to find,♫

711
00:49:22,950 --> 00:49:25,470
♫As long as you're standing by my side,♫

712
00:49:25,510 --> 00:49:28,790
♫With you, the only one I'd choose every time,♫

713
00:49:28,820 --> 00:49:32,660
♫I don't need a reason, as long as you're mine♫

714
00:49:33,210 --> 00:49:35,610
♫As long as you hold my hand,♫

715
00:49:36,320 --> 00:49:38,830
♫As long as next to me is where you stand,♫

716
00:49:38,830 --> 00:49:42,190
♫You're the one I'll always try to understand,♫

717
00:49:42,210 --> 00:49:46,010
♫No matter how hard the road may be,♫

718
00:49:46,590 --> 00:49:49,070
♫Just hold my hand, and we'll be free♫

719
00:49:49,830 --> 00:49:52,470
♫As long as you're here with me♫

720
00:49:53,800 --> 00:49:59,380
♫I rest my hands, holding on to yours♫

721
00:50:00,510 --> 00:50:05,740
♫You chased away my uncertainty♫

722
00:50:07,140 --> 00:50:12,090
♫No words were said, but I hear you♫

723
00:50:13,400 --> 00:50:19,070
♫Loud and clear, it's meant to be♫

